      "case": "iff-forward",
      "by": "/root/math81_frattini_placement",
      "reason": "Cutting each through strand gives inverse pairs of link states; reflection and propagation ideals prove the cellular axioms. The phrase exactly when prescribes the label order r<=t, not a biconditional characterization of cellular algebras. The detected iff words define a relation or qualify a later claim; they do not assert a biconditional theorem in this carrier."
